# Speed-Rate Bridge Tests
# Tests bidirectional coercion between Speed quantities and Rates.

## Speed to Rate conversion (Speed quantity -> Rate target with time denominator)
bridge1 = 60 kph in m/s
# Expected: 16.66

## Rate to Speed conversion (Rate -> Speed quantity target)
bridge2 = 60 km/h in mph
# Expected: 37.28

## Speed accumulation via over (Speed quantity * duration)
distance1 = 60 mph over 2 hours
# Expected: 120 mi

## Speed x Duration arithmetic
distance2 = 60 kph * 2 hours
# Expected: 120 km
